  "description": "Runtime registry and OpenTelemetry/Prometheus exporter for production code coverage in .NET and Blazor applications. Receives Hit() calls from assemblies instrumented by BlazorAmpowering.Coverage (the Fody weaver) and exports three metrics — coverage_method_info, coverage_method_hit, and coverage_method_calls_total — via the standard OTel Metrics API. Install once in the entry project and call builder.AddProductionCoverage() in Program.cs.",
